{"unit_id":"cyanovo__dsh-remote-qqbot#feature-1","repo":"cyanovo/dsh-remote-qqbot","commit":"bc719fefcd7bffc05faf0ca646e45487da7e8283","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-remote-qqbot 的功能「QQ 会话通知」：监听 DSH 会话完成、提问和错误等事件，并通过 QQ 机器人向用户发送对应消息。 通过 DSH 事件监听或已注册工具触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:712-730"]}
